    "title": "Boise officially hit 80 degrees Wednesday afternoon, breaking a record not seen since 1875 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CBS2 News Staff ,\n6 hours ago BOISE, Idaho (CBS2) — The National Weather Service in Boise is reporting that Boise officially hit 80 degrees at 4:36 pm on Wednesday, a new record. According to NWS Boise, this is the earliest date Boise has hit 80 degrees in records dating back to 1875, and only the second time we have hit 80 degrees during winter. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
